'''Professional Babbler (Merciless)''' is the second and final stage in [[NEO First Errand]]. Clearing this [[No Continues]] stage unlocks the [[True Form]] of [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Bakery Cat]], Fried Chicken Cat.

